# Natural Language Processing.

**Authors:** Chowdhury, Gobinda G.

## Abstract
Discusses issues related to natural language processing, including theoretical developments; natural language understanding; tools and techniques; natural language text processing systems; abstracting; information extraction; information retrieval; interfaces; software; Internet, Web, and digital library applications; machine translation for multilingual retrieval; and evaluation. (Contains 136 references.) (LRW)

